The task is complete. Here's what was implemented:

**`rust/src/lib.rs`** — added `filter_by_tag`:

```rust
pub fn filter_by_tag<'a>(notes: &'a [Note], tag: &str) -> Vec<&'a Note> {
    notes
        .iter()
        .filter(|n| n.tags.contains(&tag.to_string()))
        .collect()
}
```

- Exact match on each note's `tags` vector (not substring)
- Preserves relative order from the input slice
- Returns references, no allocation of Note structs

**`rust/src/main.rs`** — wired `--tag <TAG>` into the `list` command:

